          <p>
            Across 349 anonymized live multi-engine turns recorded during development, fast routes (<code>claude-haiku-5-5</code>: 34/34, mean 23.9 s; <code>gemini-4-hydrogen</code>: 25/25, mean 45.8 s; <code>gpt-6-luna</code>: 9/10, mean 49.3 s) handle scoped work quickly, whereas frontier reasoning routes (<code>gemini-4-neon</code>: 123/146, mean 132.7 s; <code>gpt-6.2-sol</code>: 41/54, mean 444.0 s) consume 10×–100× more tokens per turn and encounter rate limits when invoked indiscriminately.
